# foundry's credentials, one KEY=value per line — `foundry auth` writes them
# here (chmod 600). Copy to .env (gitignored); never commit the real file.
# The CLI, infra.sh and the web server all read this one file, fresh each time.

# Claude credential for every forge: `foundry auth` (setup-token) or `--api-key`
# CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# MCP gateway — what forges present to it. The gateway is argus's; `foundry auth
# --linear` / `--slack` copy argus's MCP_GATEWAY_TOKEN here.
# FOUNDRY_MCP_TOKEN=
# Which of its upstreams forges register (default: both)
# FOUNDRY_MCP_SERVERS=linear,slack

# The upstream keys (LINEAR_API_KEY, SLACK_TOKEN) live in argus's .env, read from
# ARGUS_ENV (default ~/git/argus/.env); a value here is only a fallback. They never
# enter a forge.

# Bearer token for POST /api/jobs, minted by `foundry auth --api`
# FOUNDRY_API_TOKEN=
